{"name": "Ripple Park", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A meticulously crafted <strong>Metroidbrainia</strong> game. You find yourself lost in a vast maze filled with pools, where secrets lie beneath their calm and gentle surfaces. Various traps and mechanisms hinder your progress, and unknown entities instill fear in your heart. Search for specific items and leverage the behaviors of unknown creatures. You will unravel the puzzles, uncover your past, and ultimately make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by poolcore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Items and Puzzles Throughout the Maze: </strong>A variety of items, each with different functions and methods of use. Multiple areas feature diverse themes and puzzles. Interact with items and rooms to solve puzzles and open new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/4226b872988bf24c9310aaa0832f0b8d.poster.avif?t=1780064857\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/4226b872988bf24c9310aaa0832f0b8d.webm?t=1780064857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/4226b872988bf24c9310aaa0832f0b8d.mp4?t=1780064857\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/6769b96f3359161e3868f34e98157f3a.poster.avif?t=1780064857\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/6769b96f3359161e3868f34e98157f3a.webm?t=1780064857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/6769b96f3359161e3868f34e98157f3a.mp4?t=1780064857\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br/><strong>Excellent Platforming Mechanics: </strong>The maze is filled with various mechanisms and traps, and the precise platforming characteristics empower you to explore without fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/ddbb4715e8e8423e840055f035e26b69.poster.avif?t=1780064857\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/ddbb4715e8e8423e840055f035e26b69.webm?t=1780064857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/ddbb4715e8e8423e840055f035e26b69.mp4?t=1780064857\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/8bfee18bc89e394970515974c91a3bb6.poster.avif?t=1780064857\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/8bfee18bc89e394970515974c91a3bb6.webm?t=1780064857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/8bfee18bc89e394970515974c91a3bb6.mp4?t=1780064857\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Variety of Entity Enemies: </strong>The maze is teeming with unknown entities; some are friendly, while others are dangerous. Understanding them, fleeing, or exploiting them is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/b6a38eaf432096679af863f44815f408.poster.avif?t=1780064857\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/b6a38eaf432096679af863f44815f408.webm?t=1780064857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/b6a38eaf432096679af863f44815f408.mp4?t=1780064857\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interactive Pixel Elements:</strong> The maze features various interactive pixel scenes, such as water and fog, providing a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/11900be28465bd405cafccab44be3046.poster.avif?t=1780064857\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/11900be28465bd405cafccab44be3046.webm?t=1780064857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/11900be28465bd405cafccab44be3046.mp4?t=1780064857\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/0187bff732e4727ae7ce37e65ee62abb.poster.avif?t=1780064857\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/0187bff732e4727ae7ce37e65ee62abb.webm?t=1780064857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/0187bff732e4727ae7ce37e65ee62abb.mp4?t=1780064857\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pixel Art Style Pool Core Scenes:</strong>\u00a0Unlike traditional 3D pool cores, the side-scrolling pixelated pool landscapes are equally captivating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/8d1594ae9aee8b830d5d906a00e590a7.poster.avif?t=1780064857\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/8d1594ae9aee8b830d5d906a00e590a7.webm?t=1780064857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/extras/8d1594ae9aee8b830d5d906a00e590a7.mp4?t=1780064857\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "You are lost in a vast and eerie labyrinth filled with pools and puzzles. Gather items to activate various mechanisms as you explore further. Face various unknown entities that lurk within. Unravel the mysteries of the labyrinth and your own identity to find your way out. Inspired by poolcore.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398670/header.jpg?t=1780064857", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Metroidvania", "Exploration", "Puzzle", "Pixel Graphics", "Puzzle Platformer", "Platformer"], "developers": "Phase Wanderer", "publishers": "Phase Wanderer", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3398670", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "2 March 2025 - Request Access\n\n28 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/aDM43GVFPt4", "first_seen": 1740873600.0, "review_rank": 1775}